{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80\u00a0<strong>Play fair. Die first.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheater\u2019s Table is an online multiplayer card game with a noir-mafia atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match color or number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the first to empty your hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone starts with 2 lives. The last one standing wins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One more thing: you must also get rid of the hidden Milk card before the round ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c7f3ca36e36a6d70a320b6c21fb59430.poster.avif?t=1773149636\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c7f3ca36e36a6d70a320b6c21fb59430.webm?t=1773149636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c7f3ca36e36a6d70a320b6c21fb59430.mp4?t=1773149636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Cheat Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here\u2019s the real deal: <strong>cheating</strong>. You can secretly reach for powerful cards.<br>If no one calls you out, the advantage is yours.<br>If someone catches you, you lose 1 life.<br>If you pretend to cheat and bait them, they fall into your trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the more you get away with it, the riskier your next cheat becomes. But the reward grows too.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Bait and Bluff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes not cheating is stronger than cheating.<br>Abort at the last second and bait them (Abort card).<br>Make your opponent hesitate.<br>Punish false accusations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tension isn\u2019t random. It\u2019s psychological.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/00f0200467e9f6acea51ee80c0c9e5f6.poster.avif?t=1773149636\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/00f0200467e9f6acea51ee80c0c9e5f6.webm?t=1773149636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/00f0200467e9f6acea51ee80c0c9e5f6.mp4?t=1773149636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udccf Special Cards</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw</strong> (forces your opponent to draw cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Shield</strong> (neutralizes cards sent to you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acid</strong> and <strong>King Acid</strong> (melts same-colored cards in your hand)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paint Can</strong> (turns all cards into one color)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gift</strong> and <strong>Reject Gift</strong> (send a ticking bomb, or send it back)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cadillac</strong> (surprise)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Milk</strong> (the surprise card you must discard to win)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bait</strong> (Abort card)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More surprise cards...</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cards are simple. The strategy runs deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/67f58d5b9c64dd2b7341493c3a6b1da2.poster.avif?t=1773149636\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/67f58d5b9c64dd2b7341493c3a6b1da2.webm?t=1773149636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/67f58d5b9c64dd2b7341493c3a6b1da2.mp4?t=1773149636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Pink Cadillac</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23f3 Match Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host can choose:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match duration (5\u201320 min or unlimited)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lives (1\u20133)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mode: <strong>Milk / Light Milk (no cheating)</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Chat Supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u20134 Players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social Deduction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c8944989f895086ece898d1501cf73aa.poster.avif?t=1773149636\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c8944989f895086ece898d1501cf73aa.webm?t=1773149636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/extras/c8944989f895086ece898d1501cf73aa.mp4?t=1773149636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hands are free</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"ht